[{"client_msg_id":"57745112-5076-4935-8ad5-0373020e883a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"こないだ卵買った袋落としたんですけど割1ヒビ1ですんでちょっと感動した","ts":"1630504890.044900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l8hI7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dd3c07d-c614-434e-ab1a-a29f80e82ead","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"まあ現実の卵を考えると、一致はしてない気がしますね…簡単に割ることができるし","ts":"1630504826.043500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b48d69b2-9fc8-4ad9-a9b8-eda054859e17","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"（静的な）圧縮応力に強い形状と衝撃に強い形状って同じだろうか？","ts":"1630504683.042600","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1630504802.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xcz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e7f863a-5edc-484d-882d-14cf76069007","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"とりあえず圧縮応力に対して強い曲面にはなってそうですよね","ts":"1630504662.041900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hRcO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c29519d1-7e07-4487-87af-6eddf87eee2e","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"この世のありとあらゆる鳥の卵を集めて共通の数式を見つけた、というのもロマンがあっていいですが、何らかの条件を満たす解としてこの数式が導かれたりなんかしたらすごく面白そうですね。\nたとえば「卵が転がるときの距離」みたいな物理量があったとして、その物理量を最小化するような解が実はこの式で表される曲面だった、みたいな","ts":"1630504413.040900","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1630504443.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d0hU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12f5be3d-c864-422f-a614-21bbbea06917","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"昆虫は変形タイプいろいろあるけど、回りの素材もちがうしな...\n爬虫類系はカプセルの外形のやつとかあるねえ","ts":"1630504279.039300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"16x9t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1fc511fc-c20a-489c-88f8-5c18e3e08f72","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"そういえば歪んだ卵ってみたことないな","ts":"1630504210.038200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hhpv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12761058-15ca-4631-a41f-6ed3ecaa7c9c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"もしかして俺が知らないだけで卵の外形理論学会みたいのがあんのかな","ts":"1630503758.037000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gqd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"09a0bcc5-115a-4a35-9da0-3447e779e6d7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"楕円はしらなかったなあ...","ts":"1630502951.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VL="}]},{"client_msg_id":"6032dddf-9c89-488a-80dd-8a2bf0663455","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"意外とオーバル型までは比較的単純な無理式で表せるんですね。知らなかった\n（上の画像の式の2, 3 行目が洋ナシ型に対応するための補正式で、1行目だけでオーバル型までは表せるっぽい）","ts":"1630502885.035800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qn4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73918de1-9516-4726-981b-d8439c6c0b8b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"マニアックぅ","ts":"1630499741.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1bDc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d2c6657-e73d-4522-bf5d-5f91baff2049","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1433037716250193926?s=19|https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1433037716250193926?s=19\u003e","ts":"1630499735.034000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/Science_Release|@Science_Release\u003e: 全ての卵の形状を1個の式で表す、数学的な「卵型の一般方程式」が完成したよ！形が4種類に大別される鳥の卵の形状を4つのパラメータのみで導くよ！リプで解説するね！\n\nValeriy G. Narushin, et al. \"Egg and math: introducing a universal formula for egg shape\". Ann. N. Y. Acad. Sci., 2021. \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-MrqKBUUAY-iNQ.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"彩恵りり (科学系ニュース解説アカウント)","author_subname":"@Science_Release","author_link":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1433037716250193926","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1423908231282266114/UYmgV3IC_normal.jpg","text":"全ての卵の形状を1個の式で表す、数学的な「卵型の一般方程式」が完成したよ！形が4種類に大別される鳥の卵の形状を4つのパラメータのみで導くよ！リプで解説するね！\n\nValeriy G. Narushin, et al. \"Egg and math: introducing a universal formula for egg shape\". Ann. N. Y. Acad. Sci., 2021. \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-MrqKBUUAY-iNQ.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/E-MrqKBUUAY-iNQ.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1630497790,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1433037716250193926?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/Science_Release/status/1433037716250193926?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"egg","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NGg3"}]}]
